==== Flash Layout ====
^ Layer0 |  m25p80 spi0.0: w25q128 (16384 KiB)  ||||||||
^ Layer1 |  **mtd0** \\ ''routerboot'' \\ 0x000000000000-0x00000000e000 \\ 54 KiB  |  **mtd1** \\ ''hard_config'' \\ 0x00000000e000-0x00000000f000 \\ 4 KiB  |  **mtd2** \\ ''bios'' \\ 0x00000000f000-0x000000010000 \\ 4 KiB  |  **mtd3** \\ ''routerboot2'' \\ 0x000000010000-0x00000001f000 \\ 60 KiB  |  **mtd4** \\ ''soft_config'' \\ 0x00000001f000-0x000000020000 \\ 4 KiB  |  **mtd5** \\ ''firmware'' \\ 0x000000020000-0x000001000000 \\ 16256 KiB  |||
^ Layer2 |:::|:::|:::|:::|:::|  **mtd6** \\ ''kernel'' (uimage-fw) \\ 0x000000020000-0x0000001b0000 \\ 1600 KiB  |  **mtd7** \\ ''rootfs'' (uimage-fw) \\ 0x0000001b0000-0x000001000000 \\ 14656 KiB  ||
^ Layer3 |:::|:::|:::|:::|:::|:::|  |  **mtd8** \\ ''rootfs_data'' (squashfs-split) \\ 0x0000003a0000-0x000001000000 \\ 12672 KiB  |

